        "Content": "New to the market, this substantial two-storey detached residence presents an exciting opportunity to acquire a spacious family home set on an impressive 7.19 Acre holding in a highly convenient location. While the property requires modernisation works throughout, it retains many of its original old features and character, offering the perfect canvas for those seeking to restore it to its former charm.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned just off the main N17 Sligo to Galway Road, the propertty is located approximately 2km from the village of Kilkelly, providing easy access to everyday amenities as well as excellent transport links. Ireland West Airport Knock is just a short drive away, making this an ideal location for commuters or those seeking a peaceful rural setting with exceptional connectivity.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is both spacious and versatile. The ground floor comprises a welcoming Entrance Hallway, Sitting Room with an open Fireplace, Kitchen, small Utility Area and a ground floor Bedroom complete with an En-Suite Bathroom. Upstairs, there are three further well-proportioned Bedrooms, a family Bathroom and an additional room that could easily serve as a home office, study, playroom depending on individual needs.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 7.19 Acres (2.91 H.A), the Lands are contained in one compact block and consist of low-lying ground that was previously maintained as productive meadow Land. With some improvement, the Land offers the potential to be restored to good quality grassland once again. The Holding extends to a charming Brook along its boundary, enhancing the property's rural appeal.\r\n\r\nOffering enermous potential, this is an ideal project for buyers looking to create a wonderful family home while enjoying the benefits of generous grounds and a prime central location. Early viewing is highly recommended as this property has already attracted quite significant interest even before coming to the open market. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please call the sole selling agent John Higgins Auctioneer on 094 9631372."
      },
